{"time": 1770639746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207697091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“神山露同学的文学辞藻我等远不及，他的准备不能白费，我愿意把这个难得的机会给更需要的人”"}
{"time": 1770639807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "917201156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她）"}
{"time": 1770639832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803642443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(没事)"}
{"time": 1770639836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634874222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(你懂就行)"}
{"time": 1770639901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787307343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃，虽然我确实写好了，不过还是班长先吧，每个人都有分享自己文字的自由”"}
{"time": 1770639932, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024280471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "义正言辞"}
{"time": 1770639942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989560909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...神山同学的作文写得确实可以，不过既然两位彼此谦让，不妨都展示一下吧。”小叶老师认可了神山的说法"}
{"time": 1770639961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183360653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(我勒个)"}
{"time": 1770639969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748595296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "*展示自己的文笔"}
{"time": 1770640002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1618785332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=748595296]（展示在哪）"}
{"time": 1770640048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924183340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "雨天最好是初夏。并不是那种狂暴的骤雨，而是绵密的、似乎要将天地都染成青色的细雨。坐在檐廊下，看着庭院里的叶子被洗得发亮，翠绿得几乎要滴落下来，甚是清嘉。此时若能闻到屋内熏香的余韵，混合着潮湿的泥土气，便觉得心也跟着静谧了。至于夜里的雨，若是打在荷叶上，那清脆的声响，即便是在梦中听见，也是极风雅的。"}
{"time": 1770640118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "877329352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“班长写的真好啊...”感叹道"}
{"time": 1770640136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097435221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1770640154, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1329925712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hehe，那我该怎么办）"}
{"time": 1770640185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739936095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "老师带头鼓起掌，不过班里响应的人很少，想来这也是常态，小叶老师也不恼，“神山同学？”"}
{"time": 1770640288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2099393928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿起刚刚在本子上写的，读了出来"}
{"time": 1770640489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779154066", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "秋是日暮。斜阳吻过檐角，枫红柿黄染遍山野，归雁掠过天际，翅尖挑落枝头的枯叶，炊烟缠上晚霞，灶间飘出糖炒栗的香，晚风微凉，却裹着人间最踏实的烟火。"}
{"time": 1770640707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731861840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不错不错。”老师认可地点点头，“看来在随笔的散文这一块，大家也可以学着清少纳言的风格，平时多写一写。”她沉思了一下，“班长？”"}
{"time": 1770640751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672133987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“在”"}
{"time": 1770640759, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300571262", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(这个班长真是)"}
{"time": 1770640775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252637869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(太有年代感了)"}
{"time": 1770640782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "949036706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "(找不到人就让班长来答)"}
{"time": 1770640828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169401752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“每天组织一次随笔练习吧，你来督促大家，务必保证每个人都要交哦？”小叶老师笑着敲敲讲台，“写得好的同学期末加分。”"}
{"time": 1770640851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1987928903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（hyw）"}
{"time": 1770640869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1037811054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好～”反正自己本来每天都要写"}
{"time": 1770640872, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662190235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“保证完成任务”"}
{"time": 1770640902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "184418665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1370316409"}, "sender": {"id": "1370316409", "name": "折木"}, "message": "“班级总共四十二......四十一个人，我会保证每个人都交的”"}
{"time": 1770640916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1939781121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "735825367", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“放心交给你了，每个人都要写。”"}
